        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How are cars and bikes packed and transported safely on the Dhanbad‑Bhagalpur corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicles are loaded onto enclosed multi‑car trailers fitted with hydraulic ramps. Each wheel is secured with calibrated wheel chocks, and the chassis is fastened using high‑tensile ratchet lashings. Our drivers follow a dedicated vehicle‑only lane on the highway, and the cargo is monitored via live GPS, ensuring secure, damage‑free delivery.</p>
